<title>USA: Motorola gets $263.7 mln military contract.</title>
<headline>Motorola gets $263.7 mln military contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc has received a $263.7 million U.S. defense contract for ground communications equipment providing voice, data and message service for as many as 147 operational units worldwide, the Defense Department said.</p>
</text>
